{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "能冻结哪些",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 84.21,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "如果被盗的是你自己的钱，顺序也差不多。",
   "spoken": "如果被盗的是你自己的钱，顺序也差不多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.008,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.769
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "先撤销所有授权，把剩下的资产转到全新的地址，用新助记词、新设备。",
   "spoken": "先撤销所有授权，把剩下的资产转到全新的地址，用新助记词、新设备。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.828,
   "dur": 7.344,
   "speechStart": 5.926,
   "speechEnd": 12.342
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "记下被盗地址、攻击者地址、交易哈希、时间，和你点过的链接。",
   "spoken": "记下被盗地址、攻击者地址、交易哈希、时间，和你点过的链接。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 13.392,
   "dur": 6.384,
   "speechStart": 13.49,
   "speechEnd": 18.942
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "被盗的是 USDT 或 USDC，马上联系发行方，附上交易哈希。",
   "spoken": "被盗的是 USDT 或 USDC，马上联系发行方，附上交易哈希。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 19.996,
   "dur": 6.216,
   "speechStart": 20.094,
   "speechEnd": 25.379
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "钱流进了某个交易所，就通过它的官方渠道提交冻结请求。",
   "spoken": "钱流进了某个交易所，就通过它的官方渠道提交冻结请求。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 26.432,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 26.53,
   "speechEnd": 30.934
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "报警，拿到报案回执，交易所和发行方通常需要执法请求才能冻结。",
   "spoken": "报警，拿到报案回执，交易所和发行方通常需要执法请求才能冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 32.004,
   "dur": 6.672,
   "speechStart": 32.102,
   "speechEnd": 37.84
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "当心追回诈骗，说能帮你追回资金、要你先付费的人，几乎都是诈骗。",
   "spoken": "当心追回诈骗，说能帮你追回资金、要你先付费的人，几乎都是诈骗。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.896,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 38.994,
   "speechEnd": 44.125
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 45.188,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 45.286,
   "speechEnd": 46.5
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "发行方冻结，只能管到 USDT、USDC 这类有发行方的代币。",
   "spoken": "发行方冻结，只能管到 USDT、USDC 这类有发行方的代币。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 47.568,
   "dur": 6.36,
   "speechStart": 47.666,
   "speechEnd": 53.082
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "BTC、XRP、SOL 是原生资产，没有发行方，这条路管不到它们。",
   "spoken": "BTC、XRP、SOL 是原生资产，没有发行方，这条路管不到它们。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.148,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 54.246,
   "speechEnd": 60.043
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "所以第一批通知发给发行方，但不能把它当成全部方案。",
   "spoken": "所以第一批通知发给发行方，但不能把它荡成全部方案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 61.112,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 61.21,
   "speechEnd": 65.388
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "最有效的，是事先设计好的暂停和延迟，加上提前备好的地址清单和联系人。",
   "spoken": "最有效的，是事先设计好的暂停和延迟，加上提前备好的地址清单和联系人。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 66.444,
   "dur": 7.584,
   "speechStart": 66.542,
   "speechEnd": 73.184
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "钱被转走之后能追回多少，大半在出事之前就定了。",
   "spoken": "钱被转走之后能追回多少，大半在出事之前就定了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 74.248,
   "dur": 5.088,
   "speechStart": 74.346,
   "speechEnd": 78.5
  },
